    "restriction": "Retains all three corrected rate characterizations as one conjunction of Mathlib little-o and big-O equivalences for nonnegative real sequences indexed by population size. It identifies no dependency graph and does not assert that any particular sequence satisfies these conditions, prove a CLT or Chebyshev sharpness, or verify the literature attributions. The finite quotient bound is quantified only at positive population sizes; asymptotic assertions disregard the initial zero index.",
